            "href": "https://www.scb.se/MI0307-en",
            "label": "Statistics page",
            "type": "text/html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "note": [
        "Put on the market (self-reported) is based on quantities reported by producers of packaging to Swedish Environmental Protection Agency’s E-service producer responsibility.  \r\n  \r\nPut on the market (enumerated) is based on data from municipality residual waste and reported data.  Put on the market (enumerated) cannot be calculated for ferrous metal (steel), aluminium, deposit PET bottles, deposit cans, and wood due to insufficient level of detail in data.  \r\n  \r\nSeparately collected quantity of packaging waste includes waste collected in recycling containers designated for each packaging material. Small quantities of packaging waste sorted correctly from residual household waste and sent to treatment may also occur in the total quantity of separately collected packaging waste.  \r\n  \r\nThe quantity of aluminium cans and PET bottles covered by a deposit-return system has been adjusted for the estimated quantity transported out of the country.  \r\n  \r\nFor more detailed information we refer to the quality declaration för waste, packaging (in Swedish only) and the Swedish Environmental Protection Agency’s report on Sweden’s recycling of packaging (”Sveriges återvinning av förpackningar” in Swedish only)."
      ],
